# Hardcoded Shell Backgrounds

Navigation (AppRail), secondary menu (SectionNav), and page/content shell backgrounds are **design-spec hardcodes**. Do **not** map them to color tokens (`--material-*`, `--box-page`, etc.).

Define them only in `src/styles/global.css` as sRGB fallback + `color(display-p3 …)` (p3 line is canonical):

| Variable | Used by |
|----------|---------|
| `--page-background` | `html`, `body`, `#app`, layout shell |
| `--content-background` | Main content area |
| `--nav-background` | AppRail |
| `--section-nav-background` | SectionNav |

When adding light/dark theme values, add explicit hex + display-p3 pairs per theme block. Do not reference `@evergreen/tokens` semantic colors for these four variables.
